run.note:
Morning checklist for the observatory, with how long each step takes and what it needs:
uncover the mirror, 5 minutes, dust cover;
check the drive oil, 10 minutes, dipstick;
align the finder, 15 minutes, alignment laser;
cool the camera, 20 minutes, chiller;
take a dark frame, 8 minutes, shutter cap;
log the seeing, 3 minutes, seeing monitor.
